    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-στολος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in company with, attendant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχον..Μαινάδων ὁμόστολον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					212
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. ὔμμιν ἕπεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.802
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>similar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφῆς δ᾽ οὐχ ὁ. φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			.</div>
